  characterDescs:
  - A woodland marksman. Balanced speed and steel up close, with a longbow for picking
    off the horde at range.
  - "Fury made flesh. Trades finesse for raw power \u2014 a heavy axe to throw, and
    rage that turns pain into strength."
  - A master of arcane elements. Uses magic to control the battlefield.
